; Materialization corpus: an explicit author kvpair suppresses overlay
; population for that key. The schema declares `:default 32` but the
; document writes `:radius 7`; `materializeDefaults` sees the explicit
; kvpair via `authorWroteKey`, skips the overlay entry, and emits no
; diagnostic. The author tree stays the source of truth — a consumer
; that asks the overlay for `(circle, radius)` gets `null` and falls
; back to the explicit kvpair carrying 7.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name circle
    (key :name radius :type number :default 32)))

(circle :radius 7)
